    "title": "Judge dismisses most Black McDonald's franchisee claims - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Crusader Staff ,\n12 hours ago A federal judge in Chicago has dismissed most claims by 48 Black McDonald’s franchisees, significantly narrowing grounds for a potential class-action lawsuit against the fast-food chain. Separate complaints presented by 48 Black McDonald’s franchisees for a potential class-action lawsuit under the case Manning v. McDonald’s were reviewed by Judge... Read full article",
